---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How Southwala handles analytics data, cookies, advertising and affiliate links, and how to contact us about privacy questions.">
  <div class="page">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Southwala does not ask readers to create accounts. We collect only standard analytics data (pages viewed, device type, approximate location) to understand what readers like.</p>
    <h2>Your location</h2><p>To show panchangam timings for your own place, your browser asks a third-party IP lookup service (geojs.io, or ipwho.is as a backup) for the approximate city of your IP address. The result stays in your browser and is not sent to our servers. If you tap &ldquo;Use my exact location&rdquo;, your browser asks for permission first and the coordinates are used only on your device.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and ads</h2><p>We use Google Analytics and may show ads through Google AdSense. Google and its partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other sites. You can manage personalised ads at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com">adssettings.google.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>Some links may earn us a commission at no extra cost to you. Such links are labelled.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about privacy: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
